[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989603181","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107390#issuecomment-2989603181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107390","id":2989603181,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yMblt","user":{"login":"mellowminx","id":126353737,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4gBSQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126353737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx","html_url":"https://github.com/mellowminx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T02:10:50Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T02:10:50Z","body":"Another person has experienced the same issue, they [commented about it on the Godot forums](https://forum.godotengine.org/t/sounds-crash-my-web-game-on-mobile-browser-godot-4-5-dev5-html-export-on-itch/113237/8?u=mellowminx) as a response to my post:\n\n> Hey y’all! I just discovered the same issue when I loaded up my game in a phone browser for the first time since adding audio. The problem seems to only exist on iPhones (worked perfectly fine on Android with Chrome and Firefox), but it’s true on iOS Safari and Firefox. Thank you for the note on the MP3 files, I replaced the WAVs in my game with them; however, the problem still exists in the same places it did before. ~ [violet-haze](https://forum.godotengine.org/u/violet-haze)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989603181/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989604454","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107390#issuecomment-2989604454","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107390","id":2989604454,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yMb5m","user":{"login":"mellowminx","id":126353737,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4gBSQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126353737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx","html_url":"https://github.com/mellowminx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T02:11:43Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T02:13:30Z","body":"I'm so sorry, I just meant to comment with an update about another person who experienced the same issue, but I accidentally closed the issue and I cannot reopen it.\n\n**EDIT: I was able to reopen it, I don't know why I wasn't able to earlier. Apologies, I'm not so familiar with github mechanics!**\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989604454/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3000170659","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107390#issuecomment-3000170659","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107390","id":3000170659,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6y0vij","user":{"login":"davcri","id":6860637,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NjA2Mzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6860637?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davcri","html_url":"https://github.com/davcri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davcri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davcri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davcri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davcri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davcri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davcri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davcri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davcri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davcri/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T12:25:55Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T12:25:55Z","body":"Can confirm the issue. I just tested https://mellowminx.itch.io/audio-test-godot-4-5-dev-5 and it crashes on Safari on a M4 16GB MacBook Pro 2024, Sequoia 15.5.   \nHere it is a full video with Firefox and Safari side-by-side: Safari crashes at 2:08 and at 4:06, Firefox does not leak memory (at least looking at the activity monitor).\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a08f8e2-3e54-40ba-b733-943da436ce14\n\nAlso: I worked on this game https://havbit.itch.io/pangolick-quest (source is not public) and some user reported that they cannot finish the game because of browser reloads. The game is exported without thread support and uses **Default Playback Type** for AudioStreams.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3000170659/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3000815933","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107390#issuecomment-3000815933","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107390","id":3000815933,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6y3NE9","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T14:48:23Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T14:48:23Z","body":"[godot-3-5-3-audio-test-main.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20885980/godot-3-5-3-audio-test-main.zip)\n[godot-4-3-audio-test-main.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20885981/godot-4-3-audio-test-main.zip)\n[godot-4-5-dev-5-audio-test-main.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20885979/godot-4-5-dev-5-audio-test-main.zip)\n\n(For the archives.)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3000815933/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3000991279","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107390#issuecomment-3000991279","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107390","id":3000991279,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6y334v","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T15:36:05Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T15:36:05Z","body":"I confirm the issue on my iPad Pro M4 running iOS 26. And it happens even if the user never touches the page to enable sound playback.\n\n| Platform | Screenshot | Comment |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| Safari macOS | <video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d44ec940-1cbe-422c-a0dd-ce7aa95d2f8e\"> | See how the memory keeps growing. |\n| Chrome macOS | <img width=\"927\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2790bc2b-3169-42aa-8488-8f591ca64702\" /> | See how the blue line keeps going down once a while. |\n\nSeems like either Webkit doesn't ever trigger the garbage collector, or there's a leak only on Webkit. (Chrome on iOS runs on Webkit)\n\nI'm investigating.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3000991279/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3000993663","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107390#issuecomment-3000993663","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107390","id":3000993663,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6y34d_","user":{"login":"violet-haze-64","id":189668699,"node_id":"U_kgDOC04dWw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189668699?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/violet-haze-64","html_url":"https://github.com/violet-haze-64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/violet-haze-64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/violet-haze-64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/violet-haze-64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/violet-haze-64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/violet-haze-64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/violet-haze-64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/violet-haze-64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/violet-haze-64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/violet-haze-64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T15:36:57Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T15:36:57Z","body":"> Another person has experienced the same issue, they [commented about it on the Godot forums](https://forum.godotengine.org/t/sounds-crash-my-web-game-on-mobile-browser-godot-4-5-dev5-html-export-on-itch/113237/8?u=mellowminx) as a response to my post:\n> \n> > Hey y’all! I just discovered the same issue when I loaded up my game in a phone browser for the first time since adding audio. The problem seems to only exist on iPhones (worked perfectly fine on Android with Chrome and Firefox), but it’s true on iOS Safari and Firefox. Thank you for the note on the MP3 files, I replaced the WAVs in my game with them; however, the problem still exists in the same places it did before. ~ [violet-haze](https://forum.godotengine.org/u/violet-haze)\n\nHi! I'm the other person who experienced this issue. In case it helps to understand the problem, the automatic reload problem always occurs a few seconds after the first time I play audio. However, that audio trigger typically results in playing honestly around a hundred tiny instances of sound all within a few seconds of each other. I would assume that the issue came from the number of audio triggers layered at once if not for the fact that it has only been a problem on iOS so far. Any other OS has been able to handle it just fine with no issues.\n\nI've noticed that most other people encounter this issue on the scale of minutes, but my issues come up on the scale of seconds, _but only after clicking the sound_. It seems like the number of individual sound triggers might interact here. Let me know if there's any more info I can provide to help here!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3000993663/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3001292247","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107390#issuecomment-3001292247","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107390","id":3001292247,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6y5BXX","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T17:25:17Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T17:25:17Z","body":"Found the culprit line: \n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/987832be460f82206fcac1467e58efbd111c5241/platform/web/js/libs/library_godot_audio.js#L624\n\nIf commented, there's no leak at all:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d30a6ea-1c9c-4872-91cc-5ab120fa8094\n\nI'm investigating why the position worklet leaks on Webkit.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3001292247/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]